# =============================================================================
# bluealsa-utils Service Configuration
# =============================================================================
# This template configures the `bluealsa` service, which provides ALSA
# support for Bluetooth audio devices. It manages the command-line
# options passed to the `bluealsa` daemon.
# =============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# options
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Description: Command-line options passed to the bluealsa service.
#              See `man bluealsa` for supported options.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The value is quoted to ensure shell-safe parsing when the service manager
# executes the daemon. Empty defaults to an empty string.
OPTIONS="{{ options | default('') }}"